@@ -9269,3 +9269,4 @@ Did NOT modify research-roadmap.yaml or scripts/research_conductor.py. Did NOT p
 - 2026-06-17: PHASE C (CONTINUOUS SELF-LEARNING; mandated; PIVOT to the working+compounding mechanism) -- a learned A* ACTION-COST heuristic for ARC ACTION-EFFICIENCY, trained on our OWN solved-level traces. Cross-game VALUE-TRANSFER is RETIRED (3 powered nulls: exp4318 generic features, exp4331 learned-frame encoder, exp4342 action-role encoder -- all reduction ~1.0, on the exclusion manifest; the registry's own conclusion: generic/learned grid features do NOT transfer a search-value signal). The self-learning mandate PIVOTS to the mechanism the registry shows WORKS and COMPOUNDS: the per-game learned verifier (lp85: trained on L1-L2, cut HELD-OUT L3 search 9.36x). .402 advances it from a steps-to-go VALUE head (search-compute) to a learned PATH-COST heuristic that produces ACTION-MINIMAL plans -- directly serving the north-star EFFICIENCY axis (fewer ENV actions per solve / lower RHAE, the second first-class north-star metric), NOT just search compute. Train an A* path-cost heuristic on the 21 solved-level traces (state -> minimal-actions-to-win), wire it into the OfflineSolver/graph_explore as the A* cost, and measure the ACTIONS-TO-SOLVE reduction vs the current BFS/region-count plans on HELD-OUT levels (leave-some-levels-out), reproduction-gated (only plans that still reproduce count). Emit action_efficiency_improves BARE bool := (held-out actions-to-solve REDUCED vs the baseline planner, with a positive control: a level whose optimal is known). verifier_is_oracle=false (the learned heuristic is not the executable oracle). A null is COMPLETE (the value head already captures the efficiency signal). NO TRM training; do NOT re-attempt cross-game value transfer. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: learned_action_cost_reduces_actions_25_to_16; results/experiment_4353_learned_action_cost_heuristic_efficiency.json
 - 2026-06-17: PHASE E1 (SOTA-ingestion; mandatory per SOTA-Ingestion Cycle Discipline) -- ingest the SOTA for the .402 bleeding-edge forks (verifier-guided diffusion-LM search/scale-up; E3 executable-world-model deeper/multi-game ARC solves; learned action-efficiency heuristics) and MAP the strongest 3-5 methods onto the .403 roadmap, conditioned on the .402 outcomes (did S3 convert the moat to a fixed-NFE generation gain? did E3 reach ka59/tr87/ft09/deeper levels? did the learned action-cost heuristic lower env-actions?). Use the RELIABLE channel ONLY (scripts/sweep_clusters.py / sweep_semscholar.py + low-concurrency WebSearch/WebFetch) -- /deep-research is BANNED in-loop. Every method MUST carry a real, VERIFIED arXiv ID/URL (no citation = fabrication). FLAG A2D2 (2606.13565) + SEPO (2502.01384) verifier-as-reward GENERATOR-training as OUT-OF-BAND/operator-owned (NOT auto-run in-loop). Update research-studying.md (mark ingested) and emit flagged_for_v403 (the single strongest method for the .403 planner). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: sota_ingestion_v403_mapped; results/experiment_4354_sota_ingestion_v403.json
 - 2026-06-17: PHASE E2 (INFRA/HYGIENE) -- registry/gaps hygiene + GAP-4 regression guard + FIX the .401 capstone verifier_is_oracle stamping bug. (1) Reconcile ops/verifier_registry.yaml + ops/verifier_gaps.md + ops/arc_solve_registry.yaml with the .402 outcomes (S3 moat-utility, new ARC levels, the action-cost heuristic, any new missing-verifier gaps logged by exp4350-4353). (2) Run the GAP-4 regression guard (the ARC oracle-distinct verifier-beats-vote result must not silently regress). (3) FIX the capstone-stamping bug: the .401 capstone (exp4346) carried a CIRCULAR_MOAT_OVERCLAIM critical flag because it OMITTED verifier_is_oracle (set None, not false) even though the underlying moat (exp4338) is correctly oracle-distinct -- the capstone aggregation must PROPAGATE verifier_is_oracle from the moat artifact it reads, so the .402 capstone (exp4357) does NOT recur the flag. Verify the fix by re-running adversarial_verify.py on a stamped sample capstone. NO production verifier edits (audit-only per Verifier Authenticity Discipline). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: registry_gaps_arc_reconciled_to_v402_truth_gap4_guard_passed_True_capstone_stamp_fix_verified_True; results/experiment_4355_registry_gaps_hygiene_capstone_stamp_fix.json
+- 2026-06-17: PHASE E3 (HARDWARE CONTINUITY; KV260 opportunistic per north-star §3) -- KV260 SSH-reachability + loaded-bitstream continuity check. Per north-star §3, KV260 is THE sovereignty story (drive to terminal, then freeze); GateMate/PolarFire are opportunistic-only. SSH-reachability precondition ONLY (NEVER a host SD-card precondition per KV260 SSH-Not-SD-Card Discipline). If the board is reachable, record the loaded overlay (xmutil listapps) + a lightweight liveness check (the carnot_ising bitstream UIO device present); if it is the terminal board-latency transcript, capture it. If unreachable -> honest_verdict blocked_kv260_ssh_unreachable (a clean documented skip, NOT a fabrication). This keeps the board visible in the milestone retro without burning a deep task slot. NO host SD-card-device precondition (the retired mechanism). NO TRM training. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success_kv260_continuity_terminal_reached; results/experiment_4356_hardware_continuity_kv260.json
